% Scenario: three pages in order. A different rectangle is filled before
% each showpage; the page tree counts three and each content stream
% holds its own rectangle.
0 0 100 100 rectfill
showpage
100 100 100 100 rectfill
showpage
200 200 100 100 rectfill
showpage
